# What Vercel receives for the public copy (design 12.5): its code, the measures that its
# pages show, the saved pages and answers it reads, and its counts of requests. Nothing else
# is sent: every line below names what goes, after the first, which leaves out the rest.
# No line ends with a slash: Vercel's matching re-includes a folder only by its bare name.
/*
!/pyproject.toml
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/jevadu.py
!/src
!/evals
/evals/*
!/evals/results
!/data
/data/*
!/data/raw
!/data/requests
# Files shared by a link, served by the host from its CDN at the root of the address; the folder
# is not in git.
!/public
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
